1
00:00:00,096 --> 00:00:02,976
(Penny:)Okay. Yeah, well, I'm just gonna go eat
my dinner elsewhere.

2
00:00:03,141 --> 00:00:06,231
(Penny:)Maybe an airplane headed
for a mountainside.

3
00:00:06,645 --> 00:00:09,355
Penny, wait. Aah.

4
00:00:09,731 --> 00:00:12,111
(Leonard:)What is wrong with you?

5
00:00:12,359 --> 00:00:13,899
[DOOR SLAMS]

6
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:18,660
(Sheldon:)I sense I may have crossed
some sort of line.

7
00:00:19,324 --> 00:00:21,664
(Raj:)-Yeah, you--
-Don't tell him.

8
00:00:21,826 --> 00:00:24,666
(Howard:)Let's see if he can figure it out.

9
00:00:29,334 --> 00:00:32,334
(Penny:)-Ugh. I am so embarrassed.
-Please don't be mad.

10
00:00:32,504 --> 00:00:34,334
(Penny:)-What did you tell them?
-Nothing bad.

11
00:00:34,506 --> 00:00:36,506
(Leonard:)Just that last night was fine.

12
00:00:36,675 --> 00:00:38,845
(Penny:)Fine? You said it was fine?

13
00:00:39,010 --> 00:00:40,680
(Leonard:)Yeah. It's a perfectly good word.

14
00:00:40,845 --> 00:00:45,225
You put it in front of "wine" or "dining"
and you've really got something.

15
00:00:48,645 --> 00:00:53,355
(Leonard:)Okay, well, let me ask you this,
how was last night for you?

16
00:00:54,025 --> 00:00:55,565
(Leonard:)It was...

17
00:00:55,735 --> 00:00:57,195
(Howard:)...okay.

18
00:00:57,362 --> 00:00:59,192
(Leonard:)Okay?

